message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. It is a student proposal seed, not a certification or an endorsed standard."
title: "dhamaan: source traced safety evidence, a checkable assurance case and preregistered simulation for robots and drones in Gulf conditions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mueen
    given-names: Huda
version: 1.8.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hudasol/dhamaan"
keywords:
  - assurance case
  - safety case
  - robotics
  - drones
  - GNSS
  - preregistration
  - simulation credibility
  - mutation testing
  - silence audit
abstract: >-
  A source traced evidence table of robot and drone safety instruments, an audit of what those instruments leave to the
  developer for Gulf conditions, a machine checkable assurance case whose checker applies published simulation
  credibility conditions and keeps hardware claims open, preregistered seeded simulations labelled synthetic with a
  mutation audit of their predictions, a harness for a recorded data comparison that has not yet been run, a generated
  manuscript, a local command line tool, a static site and a pilot kit. Licences are proposed until the owner confirms them.
